    {
      "id": "17625wi",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. Non‑Communicable Diseases"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tqkp28c",
      "content": "• Diabetes – High blood sugar levels."
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "Vaccination stimulates the immune system to produce memory cells without causing the disease itself.",
      "id": "8m90gb7"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "i29pe07",
      "content": "• Hypertension – High blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bj3md75",
      "content": "• Cancer – Uncontrolled cell division."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tje4ldd",
      "content": "• Heart disease – Affects heart function."
    },
    {
